  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Mvi 208.16 Appeal of Sanction Imposed by Board. Any decision or order of the board shall remain in full force and effect pending the outcome of the appeal or expiration of the decision or order imposed.\n\nSource. #6980, eff 4-21-99, EXPIRED: 4-21-07\n\nNew. #8978, INTERIM, eff 9-14-07, EXPIRES: 3-12-08; ss by #9043-A, eff 11-29-07",
